# Two Ice Cauldrons, one each: Bot1's is paid {B} and exiles Dark Ritual, then Bot2's is paid {G} and exiles Lightning Bolt.
# Each one's mana ability reads only its own note and its own exiled card (CR 607.2a, 607.2e: linked abilities of that
# object): after Bot2's Cauldron is destroyed, Bot1's adds {B} for Dark Ritual, not {G} for the Bolt. And a card a Cauldron
# exiled may still be cast once it is gone (the ruling; the permission is the card's for as long as it stays exiled, CR
# 611.2a): Bot2 casts that Bolt from exile.
